"description" = "Vela turns one desired future into an evolving narrated memory, one grounded action for today, and a private constellation of real-world proof.\n\nIMAGINE. ACT. NOTICE. EVOLVE.\n• Name the future you want and why it matters\n• Step into a sensory chapter written from your own words\n• Receive one small, observable bridge from the story into today\n• Record what you did, moved, or learned\n• Watch that evidence become part of tomorrow's chapter\n\nA STORY THAT REMEMBERS REAL LIFE\nVela does not hand you the same visualization every day. Each chapter avoids past scenes and, once you record evidence, the next chapter begins from what actually happened. Your imagined future and your lived behaviour grow together.\n\nYOUR PROOF CONSTELLATION\nSmall actions become visible points across a seven-day arc. There is no score and no punishment for a quiet day—only an honest record of movement.\n\nLISTEN OR READ, FULLY OFFLINE\nStories are created on your device and can be narrated with the device voice. No account, server, tracking, or connection is required.\n\nSUPPORTING RITUALS\nAffirmations, future-self scripting, the 369 method, gratitude, and a private vision board remain available when they support your active future-memory arc.\n\nVela Plus optionally opens multiple simultaneous arcs, every affirmation collection, unlimited board cards, and all journal templates. One complete future-memory arc and unlimited listening remain free.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period; manage or cancel any time in your Apple Account settings. Lifetime is a one-time purchase.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://dhaxor.github.io/vela/privacy";
